`},{type:"paragraph",raw:"A collector needs [Collectable](../components/collectable.md), inventory, stats and movement. Work runs on its action generation, and is skipped while another collection or interaction is already using that action.",text:"A collector needs [Collectable](../components/collectable.md), inventory, stats and movement. Work runs on its action generation, and is skipped while another collection or interaction is already using that action.",tokens:[{type:"text",raw:"A collector needs ",text:"A collector needs ",escaped:!1},{type:"link",raw:"[Collectable](../components/collectable.md)",href:"development/components/collectable.html",title:null,text:"Collectable",tokens:[{type:"text",raw:"Collectable",text:"Collectable",escaped:!1}]},{type:"text",raw:", inventory, stats and movement. Work runs on its action generation, and is skipped while another collection or interaction is already using that action.",text:", inventory, stats and movement. Work runs on its action generation, and is skipped while another collection or interaction is already using that action.",escaped:!1}]},{type:"space",raw:`

