`},{type:"paragraph",raw:"Keys use the original two keyboard rows, clipped to their visible one-and-a-half-cell height. A long heading word scrolls locally instead of breaking into letter fragments.",text:"Keys use the original two keyboard rows, clipped to their visible one-and-a-half-cell height. A long heading word scrolls locally instead of breaking into letter fragments.",tokens:[{type:"text",raw:"Keys use the original two keyboard rows, clipped to their visible one-and-a-half-cell height. A long heading word scrolls locally instead of breaking into letter fragments.",text:"Keys use the original two keyboard rows, clipped to their visible one-and-a-half-cell height. A long heading word scrolls locally instead of breaking into letter fragments.",escaped:!1}]},{type:"space",raw:`

`},{type:"paragraph",raw:"Buttons precompose the game's idle, hover and pressed sprites. Interact actions also show their native stem. Choice uses dialog tabs; Stepper adds minus/plus buttons around an outlined Input. Native CSS chooses the face. Frames and inputs share whole-column measurement, so their right border stays visible on narrow screens.",text:"Buttons precompose the game's idle, hover and pressed sprites. Interact actions also show their native stem. Choice uses dialog tabs; Stepper adds minus/plus buttons around an outlined Input. Native CSS chooses the face. Frames and inputs share whole-column measurement, so their right border stays visible on narrow screens.",tokens:[{type:"text",raw:"Buttons precompose the game's idle, hover and pressed sprites. Interact actions also show their native stem. Choice uses dialog tabs; Stepper adds minus/plus buttons around an outlined Input. Native CSS chooses the face. Frames and inputs share whole-column measurement, so their right border stays visible on narrow screens.",text:"Buttons precompose the game's idle, hover and pressed sprites. Interact actions also show their native stem. Choice uses dialog tabs; Stepper adds minus/plus buttons around an outlined Input. Native CSS chooses the face. Frames and inputs share whole-column measurement, so their right border stays visible on narrow screens.",escaped:!1}]},{type:"space",raw:`

